{"text": "That is a good trick. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the hunter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I want to learn it, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he made himself dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like the shadows under the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But what about me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Asked the Leopard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Baviaan meant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Spots on your coat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the hunter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not want. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To look like the Zebra. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Leopard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will take spots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But please do not make them too big. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hunter put. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His five fingers close together. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he pressed them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All over the Leopards sandy coat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everywhere they touched. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They left five little black marks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now the Leopard could hide anywhere. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the two lived happily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They never changed again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because they were happy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just as they were.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "t", "r", "i", "c", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "e", "a", "r", "n", " ", "i", "t", ",", " ", "t", "o", "o", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", " ", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "h", "i", "m", "s", "e"